      <title>Stairway to Heaven, literally</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/photos/stairway-to-heaven-literally/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 24 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/photos/stairway-to-heaven-literally/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;We were completely freezing yet it was still the most captivating sunset I have witnessed to date. One minute, the clouds completely consume everything around you, the next one - completely naked mountain peaks spike into the orange sky&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
