    <item>
      <title>Twilight at Margit Hid</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/photos/twilight-at-margit-hid/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 23 Oct 2021 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/photos/twilight-at-margit-hid/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;After beautifully falling off the bike couple of times and almost crashing into a few people, I would stop here and enjoy the absolute beauty of a city this is. It is not perfect but it still is one of my most favourite places on Earth, and definitely a place that will forever hold a piece of my heart and endless bottom of memories. &amp;lt;3&lt;/p&gt;</description>
